    <string name="bienvenue_titre">Welcome!</string>
    <string name="bienvenue_texte">DodoTopia plays your songs in Heartopia: it presses the instrument keys for you. Three steps and you\'re set.</string>
    <string name="etape_1_titre">Allow DodoTopia</string>
    <string name="etape_1_texte">Turn on the “DodoTopia” accessibility service: it presses the screen and shows the bubble in the game.</string>
    <string name="etape_2_titre">Calibrate the keys</string>
    <string name="etape_2_texte">In the game, open an instrument, tap the bubble and place the dots on the keys. Once per instrument.</string>
